      "cooked": "<p>try This</p>\n<p>[</p>\n<p>SELECT<br>\nsle.item_code AS “Item Code”,<br>\ni.item_name AS “Item Name”,<br>\nsle.warehouse AS “Warehouse”,<br>\nsle.batch_no AS “Batch No”,<br>\nSUM(sle.actual_qty) AS “Quantity”,<br>\ni.stock_uom AS “UOM”<br>\nFROM <code>tabStock Ledger Entry</code> sle<br>\nJOIN <code>tabItem</code> i ON sle.item_code = i.name<br>\nWHERE sle.docstatus = 1<br>\nGROUP BY sle.item_code, sle.warehouse, sle.batch_no<br>\nORDER BY sle.item_code, sle.warehouse, sle.batch_no;</p>\n<p>]<br>\nadd filters as per your requirement</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/b/bbd66977e927efa8c455356d6f9c0bfee7632105.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/bbd66977e927efa8c455356d6f9c0bfee7632105\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/b/bbd66977e927efa8c455356d6f9c0bfee7632105_2_690x213.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"qNGF4MHiq1wPWXPscxrc8wWWYKx\" width=\"690\" height=\"213\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/b/bbd66977e927efa8c455356d6f9c0bfee7632105_2_690x213.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/b/bbd66977e927efa8c455356d6f9c0bfee7632105_2_1035x319.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/b/bbd66977e927efa8c455356d6f9c0bfee7632105_2_1380x426.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1733×537 42.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
